{{!--
    The studio window's only part: the frame its regions are drawn into (see MapStudio's
    regions and StudioView). The world bar runs across the top, a settlement map's bar under it while
    one is open (L-surface); the body below them holds the rail,
    the context panel and the map side by side, with the inspector docked at its end edge (see
    Overlay). Each placeholder is replaced by its region's own root element the first time the
    region is drawn; the edit toolbar is drawn inside the map's container.
--}}
<div class="fwmb-studio">
    <div data-region="worldbar"></div>
    <div data-region="mapbar"></div>
    <div class="fwmb-studio-body">
        <div data-region="toolbar"></div>
        <div data-region="context"></div>
        <div data-region="map"></div>
    </div>
</div>
